ursor=pointer] [offscreen]\n      - button \"Leaf Curling / Cupping\" [ref=e71] [cursor=pointer] [offscreen]\n      - button \"Stunted Bushy Growth\" [ref=e72] [cursor=pointer] [offscreen]\n    - generic:\n      - text: Or select a real field leaf sample\n      - button [ref=e73] [cursor=pointer] [offscreen]:\n        - img \"Early Blight (Alternaria solani)\"\n        - text: Tomato\n      - button [ref=e74] [cursor=pointer] [offscreen]:\n        - img \"Rice Blast (Magnaporthe oryzae)\"\n        - text: Rice / Paddy\n      - button [ref=e75] [cursor=pointer] [offscreen]:\n        - img \"Yellow Stripe Rust (Puccinia striiformis)\"\n        - text: Wheat\n      - generic [ref=e76] [cursor=pointer] [offscreen]:\n        - button \"Upload Leaf Photo / Camera\" [ref=e77] [offscreen]\n    - button \"Analyze Symptoms & Diagnose\" [ref=e78] [cursor=pointer] [offscreen]\n    - text: Agronomic Diagnostic Report · 94% Confidence Match · Moderate (Action Required)\n    - heading \"Early Blight (Alternaria solani)\" [level=3]\n    - text: Concentric target-board brown rings with yellow halo on lower older leaves first. · Organic & Bio-Remedy · Spray cold-pressed Neem Oil (5ml/L) with liquid soap emulsion, or Trichoderma viride culture (10g/L). Strip lower diseased leaves. · Scientific Chemical Treatment · Mancozeb 75% WP @ 2.5 g/L or Azoxystrobin 23% SC @ 1 ml/L. Ensure complete leaf coverage. · Long-Term Preventive Measures · Prune bottom 30 cm of foliage to eliminate soil-splash contagion; water only via drip irrigation. · Always wear safety gloves and follow recommended pre-harvest intervals (PHI) when applying chemical sprays.\n  - generic:\n    - text: Market Intelligence\n    - heading \"Live Mandi Commodity Rates & MSP Tracker\" [level=2]\n    - text: Compare daily Mandi arrival prices with the Government Minimum Support Price (MSP) to make informed selling decisions.\n    - textbox \"Filter by crop, state, or market mandi...\" [ref=e79] [offscreen]\n    - table:\n      - row:\n        - columnheader \"Crop / Commodity\"\n        - columnheader \"Mandi Market (State)\"\n        - columnheader \"Govt MSP (₹/Qtl)\"\n        - columnheader \"Modal Price (₹/Qtl)\"\n        - columnheader \"Daily Trend\"\n        - columnheader \"Arrivals\"\n      - row: Wheat (Sharbati/Mill Quality) · FAQ / Sharbati · Khanna Mandi, Punjab · ₹ · 2,275 · ₹ · 2,480 · +2.8% · 4,250 Qtl\n      - row: Paddy (Basmati 1509) · Basmati Super · Karnal Mandi, Haryana · ₹ · 2,300 · ₹ · 3,450 · +4.1% · 8,900 Qtl\n      - row: Mustard Seed · Black Mustard (Bold) · Bharatpur Mandi, Rajasthan · ₹ · 5,650 · ₹ · 5,920 · +1.9% · 3,120 Qtl\n      - row: Gram / Chickpea (Desi) · Desi Medium · Indore Mandi, Madhya Pradesh · ₹ · 5,440 · ₹ · 5,850 · +1.2% · 2,400 Qtl\n      - row: Potato (Jyoti / Kufri) · Table Grade · Agra Mandi, Uttar Pradesh · ₹ · 1,100 · ₹ · 1,540 · -1.5% · 14,500 Qtl\n      - row: Hybrid Tomato · Red Firm Ripe · Pimpalgaon Mandi, Nashik · ₹ · 1,200 · ₹ · 2,100 · +6.5% · 6,800 Crates\n      - row: Maize / Corn · Yellow Feed Grade · Gulabbagh Mandi, Bihar · ₹ · 2,090 · ₹ · 2,280 · +0.8% · 5,300 Qtl\n      - row: CTC Tea (Dust / Fannings) · BOP / Dust Grade · Guwahati Tea Auction Centre, Assam · ₹ · 180 · ₹ · 245 · +3.4% · 32,000 Pkgs\n    - text: Welfare & Grants\n    - heading \"Agricultural Welfare Schemes & Subsidies\" [level=2]\n    - text: Verified financial support, crop insurance, and solar mechanization programs for Indian farmers.\n    - generic:\n      - text: Direct Income Support\n      - heading \"PM-KISAN (Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi)\" [level=3]\n      - text: \"Financial / Equipment Benefit : · ₹6,000 per year directly credited into farmer bank accounts in three equal 4-monthly installments of ₹2,000. · Eligibility Criteria : · All landholding farmer families with cultivable land in their names. Aadhar-seeded active bank account and eKYC completed.\"\n      - button \"View Application Steps\" [ref=e80] [cursor=pointer] [offscreen]\n    - generic:\n      - text: Comprehensive Crop Insurance\n      - heading \"PMFBY (Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana)\" [level=3]\n      - text: \"Financial / Equipment Benefit : · Comprehensive risk insurance covering yield losses due to non-preventable natural risks (drought, flood, hailstorm, pests). Farmer pays only 2% for Kharif, 1.5% for Rabi. · Eligibility Criteria : · All farmers growing notified crops in notified areas including sharecroppers and tenant farmers.\"\n      - button \"View Application Steps\" [ref=e81] [cursor=pointer] [offscreen]\n    - generic:\n      - text: Up to 60% Solar Subsidy\n      - heading \"PM-KUSUM (Solar Agri Pump & Grid Subsidy)\" [level=3]\n      - text: \"Financial / Equipment Benefit : · Government subsidy of up to 60% for installing standalone solar agriculture pumps (3HP to 7.5HP) and solarizing existing grid-connected electric pumps. · Eligibility Criteria : · Farmers with agricultural land possessing an existing borewell/well requiring irrigation.\"\n      - button \"View Application Steps\" [ref=e82] [cursor=pointer] [offscreen]\n    - generic:\n      - text: Free Soil Nutrient Testing\n      - heading \"Soil Health Card Scheme (National Mission)\" [level=3]\n      - text: \"Financial / Equipment Benefit : · Free periodic testing of 12 critical soil parameters (N, P, K, S, Zn, Fe, Cu, Mn, Bo, pH, EC, OC) with customized crop-specific fertilizer dosage prescriptions. · Eligibility Criteria : · All agricultural landholders in rural panchayats across India.\"\n      - button \"View Application Steps\" [ref=e83] [cursor=pointer] [offscreen]\n- contentinfo:\n  - text: AgriSense · KrishiMitra • कृषि मित्र • কৃষি মিত্ৰ · AgriSense (KrishiMitra) is dedicated to advancing sustainable, climate-smart farming through accessible digital tools, localized agronomy, and real-time market transparency. · Offline-Ready Mode Active\n  - heading \"Quick Navigation\" [level=4]\n  - listitem:\n    - link \"Home\" [ref=e84] [cursor=pointer] [o